Platform: TryHackMe
Difficulty: Easy
Category: Linux / FTP / Web / Privilege Escalation
Target: `10.49.189.85`

---

 1. Reconnaissance

I started with an Nmap scan to identify the services running on the target: nmap -sV -sC -Pn -T4 10.49.189.85

The scan revealed an FTP service running **vsFTPd 3.0.3** and a web server

