6. Analyzing the PCAP

The PCAP contained network traffic and several interesting HTTP requests.
One particularly important request was:
GET /files/ftp/shell.php HTTP/1.1
The capture also contained a password.

I suspected this credential could belong to the `lennie` user.
I tested it with: su lennie
Using the discovered password successfully switched the shell to Lennie.
I verified:
whoami
Output: lennie

